  <div class="pq-product-story__copy">
    <h2>A lightweight electric dirt bike for weekend trails</h2>
    <p>At 55 kg, the T-01 pairs an aluminum alloy frame with a 19-inch front wheel and a 17-inch rear wheel. It’s built for recreational off-road riding, with hydraulic disc brakes for slowing down before turns and on descents. Panquire recommends a rider height of 160 to 190 cm. Adult and teen riders within that range should also check that they can comfortably handle the bike and meet local age requirements.</p>
  </div>
