<section class="pq-product-story">
  <div class="pq-product-story__image">
    <img src="{{ 'RiderHill.png' | asset_url }}" width="7680" height="4320" alt="Panquire T-01 rider on a hillside" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="pq-product-story__copy">
    <h2>Three power levels on the handlebar</h2>
    <p>The 60V electric motor delivers up to 9.5 kW of peak power. Select low, medium, or high from the handlebar as the terrain changes. There’s no clutch to work when you slow down for a tight turn or set off again.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="pq-product-story">
  <div class="pq-product-story__image">
