  <div class="pq-product-story__copy">
    <h2>Plan your range before you ride</h2>
    <p>Use the stated Eco range as a starting point when planning an out-and-back ride. Loose ground, climbs, and higher speeds can shorten it, so leave enough charge to get back. Once you’re home, the battery comes out for charging indoors with the supplied 6A charger.</p>
